## 🚀 Transformative Improvement Ideas

### 1. **Intelligent Page Mutation** (Beyond Popups → Change the Page Itself)

> Instead of overlaying popups, **rewrite parts of the actual page** based on intent.

| Scenario | What Changes |
|---|---|
| High-intent on pricing page | Replace generic CTA "Get Started" → "Start Free Trial — No Card Needed" |
| Researcher reading docs | Inject a contextual sidebar with related case studies & ROI calculator |
| Bounce risk detected | Transform the hero section to show social proof + urgency ("47 companies signed up this week") |
| Form hesitation | Simplify the form — hide optional fields, add trust badges inline next to submit |

**How**: Instead of just `injection_target_selector` + `html_payload`, introduce mutation operations:

```typescript
// New payload types beyond just "inject"
interface UiMutation {
  type: 'inject' | 'replace' | 'modify' | 'reorder' | 'highlight';
  target_selector: string;
  payload: string;        // HTML for inject/replace
  css_modifications?: Record<string, string>; // Style changes for modify
  attribute_changes?: Record<string, string>; // e.g., changing href, text
}
```

**Business Impact**: This is invisible to the user — they don't see a popup they can dismiss. The page itself feels more relevant. Conversion rates improve because CTAs, copy, and layout adapt to where the user is in their buying journey.

