### 4. **Smart Content Personalization** (Rewrite Copy Based on Intent)

> Use Gemini to **rewrite existing page copy** based on what the visitor cares about.

| Signal | Page Adaptation |
|---|---|
| User selected text about "security" | Headline changes from "The #1 Platform" → "Enterprise-Grade Security, Trusted by Fortune 500" |
| User came from a competitor's comparison page (referrer) | Add a comparison table above the fold |
| User spent 30s on pricing → moved away → came back | Show annual pricing (bigger discount) as default instead of monthly |
| User's geolocation is in EU | Emphasize GDPR compliance, show EU data center locations |

**How**: New mutation type `content_personalization`:

