interface ContentPersonalization {
  selector: string;
  original_text: string;
  personalized_text: string;
  reason: string; // For analytics: "user_selected_security_terms"
}
```

**Business Impact**: Every visitor sees a page that speaks to *their specific concerns*. This is what sales teams do in 1:1 conversations — now automated for every website visitor.

